## Why This Is Asked
This question explores runtime extensibility and undoable actions through a practical pattern common in tooling and scripting domains.

## Key Concepts
- **Command pattern** with undo support
- **Runtime plugin registry** for lazy loading
- **Safe macro/sequence composition** with transactional semantics
